# 换行策略：仓库内一律存 LF，检出也用 LF。
# 本机 core.autocrlf=true 会在检出时把 LF 换成 CRLF，导致 git diff 出现整文件的假改动；
# 这里的 eol=lf 覆盖它，只对本仓库生效，不动全局 git 配置。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本：CRLF 才不会被旧版 cmd/PowerShell 挑剔
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制与图片：不做任何换行处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.eot binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.7z binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.pyc binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.obj binary
